{"seq":3,"slug":"maturity-cost","title":"技术成熟度与成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/foundations/maturity-cost","wordCount":1337,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"技术成熟度与成本\">技术成熟度与成本</h1><p>CCUS 最常被误解的一点，是把它当成「尚未发明」的未来技术。其实在天然气净化和化肥行业，从烟气里分离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 已经做了半个多世纪——胺法吸收的工业历史可以追溯到 1930 年代。真正卡住大规模部署的不是技术不存在，而是成本：在没有碳价或补贴的市场里，捕集一吨 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的钱往往比直接排放要多得多。所以衡量 CCUS，要同时拿两把尺子——技术成熟度（它能不能做）和成本（它划不划算）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>技术成熟度通常用 TRL（Technology Readiness Level，1–9 级）刻画：1–3 是基础研究，4–6 是中试验证，7–9 是工程示范到商业运行。成本则用「捕集一吨 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的平准化成本」（LCOC，Levelized Cost of Capture）衡量，并需进一步区分「捕集成本」「避免成本」与「全链成本」这三个容易混淆的口径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[TRL 技术成熟度] --&gt; B[1-3 基础研究]&#10;  A --&gt; C[4-6 中试验证]&#10;  A --&gt; D[7-9 示范到商业]&#10;  E[成本口径] --&gt; F[捕集成本&lt;br/&gt;仅分离纯化]&#10;  E --&gt; G[避免成本&lt;br/&gt;扣除捕集自身能耗排放]&#10;  E --&gt; H[全链成本&lt;br/&gt;捕集+运输+封存]\">flowchart TD\n  A[TRL 技术成熟度] --&gt; B[1-3 基础研究]\n  A --&gt; C[4-6 中试验证]\n  A --&gt; D[7-9 示范到商业]\n  E[成本口径] --&gt; F[捕集成本&lt;br/&gt;仅分离纯化]\n  E --&gt; G[避免成本&lt;br/&gt;扣除捕集自身能耗排放]\n  E --&gt; H[全链成本&lt;br/&gt;捕集+运输+封存]</pre><p>下表给出各主流技术的成熟度与单位成本量级，浓度差异如何拉开成本已在<a href=\"sources-pathways\">碳源与减排路径</a>铺垫，此处给数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>TRL</th>\n<th>典型捕集成本（美元/吨）</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高浓度源分离（制氨、乙醇）</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>15–30</td>\n<td>近乎免分离，成本主要在压缩运输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>燃烧后胺法（电厂/水泥）</td>\n<td>9 / 7–8</td>\n<td>50–110</td>\n<td>工业部署中，成本随源浓度波动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>富氧燃烧</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>60–110</td>\n<td>需空分制氧，能耗集中在前端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>燃烧前（IGCC + 物理吸收）</td>\n<td>6–7</td>\n<td>50–90</td>\n<td>多与制氢联产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接空气捕集 DAC</td>\n<td>6–7</td>\n<td>400–1000</td>\n<td>大气浓度极低，成本最高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三种成本口径别混淆\">三种成本口径别混淆</h2><p>新闻里说「捕集成本 50 美元一吨」时，往往没说清是哪种口径，而它们能差出一倍。<strong>捕集成本</strong>只算把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分离纯化出来的钱。<strong>避免成本</strong>（cost of CO₂ avoided）则要扣掉捕集过程自身消耗能源带来的额外排放——因为捕集设备要耗电耗蒸汽，等于多烧了燃料、多排了碳，真正「避免」的净排放少于捕集量，所以避免成本恒高于捕集成本。<strong>全链成本</strong>还要叠加运输和封存。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>避免成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>capture</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>transport</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>storage</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>avoided</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{避免成本} = \\frac{C_{\\text{capture}} + C_{\\text{transport}} + C_{\\text{storage}}}{\\Delta E_{\\text{avoided}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">避免成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">avoided</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">capture</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transport</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">storage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中分母 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>avoided</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta E_{\\text{avoided}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">avoided</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是「带捕集」与「不带捕集」两种工况的净排放差，它小于捕集量本身。比较不同项目时，务必确认大家用的是同一把尺子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本是怎么构成的\">成本是怎么构成的</h2><p>捕集成本里最大的两块是能耗与资本开支。以最成熟的燃烧后胺法为例，把吸收了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的胺溶液加热再生、放出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这一步需要大量蒸汽，这部分「再生能耗」常占运行成本的一半以上，也是各家溶剂研发竞相压低的指标，细节见<a href=\"../capture/post-combustion\">燃烧后捕集</a>。资本开支则取决于烟气流量——流量越大、浓度越低，吸收塔越庞大。把这两项拆开看，就能理解为什么高浓度源便宜（能耗资本双低）、DAC 昂贵（处理海量空气，能耗资本双高）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学习曲线-越做越便宜\">学习曲线：越做越便宜</h2><p>光伏组件价格在过去二十年跌了九成多，靠的是「学习曲线」——累计装机每翻一番，成本下降一个固定百分比。CCUS 尤其是 DAC，目前正处在这条曲线的起点，每年成本都在快速下探。学习率可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>学习率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(x) = C_0 \\left(\\frac{x}{x_0}\\right)^{-b}, \\quad \\text{学习率} = 1 - 2^{-b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.639em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.689em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">学习率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 是累计部署量。DAC 当前成本约 400–1000 美元/吨，Climeworks 已公开把 2030 年目标定在 250–350 美元/吨，美国能源部更把广泛推广的门槛设在 100 美元/吨以下（来源：Climeworks 公司目标与美国 DOE Carbon Negative Shot）。这些目标能否兑现，取决于部署规模能否撑起学习曲线——这又回到了政策与市场，见<a href=\"../utilization-policy/carbon-market-incentives\">碳市场与激励政策</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本缺口与政策填补\">成本缺口与政策填补</h2><p>绝大多数 CCUS 项目的捕集成本高于当前的市场碳价，缺口需要外部激励填补。下面这张图把「成本—碳价—激励」的逻辑串起来：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[捕集全链成本] --&gt; B{高于碳价?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是 多数情况| C[需要补贴/税收抵免]&#10;  C --&gt; D[美国 45Q 抵免]&#10;  C --&gt; E[EU ETS + 创新基金]&#10;  C --&gt; F[自愿碳移除市场 CDR]&#10;  B --&gt;|否 少数高浓度源| G[市场可自负盈亏]&#10;  D --&gt; H[项目可融资]&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[捕集全链成本] --&gt; B{高于碳价?}\n  B --&gt;|是 多数情况| C[需要补贴/税收抵免]\n  C --&gt; D[美国 45Q 抵免]\n  C --&gt; E[EU ETS + 创新基金]\n  C --&gt; F[自愿碳移除市场 CDR]\n  B --&gt;|否 少数高浓度源| G[市场可自负盈亏]\n  D --&gt; H[项目可融资]\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H</pre><p>美国 45Q 对地质封存的点源捕集给到每吨 85 美元、对 DAC 给到每吨 180 美元（2024–2026 年水平，2027 年起随通胀调整，来源：US IRS / Global CCS Institute），这类激励的结构与各地差异是<a href=\"../utilization-policy/carbon-market-incentives\">碳市场与激励政策</a>的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CCUS 的核心技术（胺法分离）已有近百年工业史，瓶颈在成本而非技术存在性。</li>\n<li>用 TRL 看成熟度（高浓度源与电厂胺法已达 9 级，DAC 约 6–7 级），用 LCOC 看成本。</li>\n<li>三种成本口径——捕集、避免、全链——常被混用，避免成本恒高于捕集成本，比较前务必对齐口径。</li>\n<li>成本主要由能耗（尤其溶剂再生）与资本开支构成，二者都随源浓度下降而上升。</li>\n<li>DAC 正处于学习曲线起点，成本快速下探（目标 2030 年 250–350 美元/吨、长期 &lt;100 美元/吨），兑现与否取决于部署规模与政策激励能否填上成本缺口。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"技术成熟度与成本","id":"技术成熟度与成本"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三种成本口径别混淆","id":"三种成本口径别混淆"},{"level":2,"text":"成本是怎么构成的","id":"成本是怎么构成的"},{"level":2,"text":"学习曲线：越做越便宜","id":"学习曲线-越做越便宜"},{"level":2,"text":"成本缺口与政策填补","id":"成本缺口与政策填补"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"碳源与减排路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/foundations/sources-pathways"},"next":{"title":"燃烧后捕集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/capture/post-combustion"}}